          "id": "hcMlD",
          "name": "Annotation / Logic",
          "fill": "#E5E7EB",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Shared patterns for following screens: filters, table, upload, account menu, and archive confirmation.\nSelection, information, success, warning, and error differ through labels and icons as well as color.\nFile limits and archive availability must be validated against the implementation.",
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
