          "type": "text",
          "id": "ksI1I",
          "name": "Annotation / Logic",
          "fill": "#E5E7EB",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Priority: current release → next action → blocking feedback. The artist should not have to find a task inside statistics.\nReview release opens the release at its incomplete rights section. Resolved items leave Needs attention; a deadline never publishes anything by itself.\nThe catalog shows current state; analytics covers a defined period. No data is not zero. Every value and event in this design is illustrative.",
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
