          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Tracks and Releases are two views of one catalog. Search stays within the selected tab; filters combine and reset through one action. A row opens details, Play keeps the current screen, and the menu contains contextual actions.\nStatuses describe file stage: Draft, Processing, Ready, Needs changes, Published, and Upload failed. Archive and delete are not primary row actions. All data is illustrative.",
