          "content": "Track and release metadata are edited separately while preserving shared catalog context. Required, Optional, and Read only are distinct before input. A save error must not clear the form. Open workspace leads to tasks, versions, and feedback; it does not replace saving. Delivery-specific identifiers and limits are not shown as known until requirements are confirmed.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "AWxvJ",
      "x": 64000,
      "y": 12640,
      "name": "Product Note / Logic — EP / Album track order",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 160,
      "fill": "$color-background-tinted",
      "cornerRadius": 18,
      "stroke": "$color-border",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 10,
      "padding": [
        22,
        26
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "uykMA",
          "name": "RU Note / Title",
          "fill": "$color-accent",
          "content": "Logic — EP / Album track order",
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "l3pCI",
          "name": "RU Note / Body",
          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1388,
          "content": "Track order is an explicit part of a multi-track release. Drag-and-drop has an accessible Move up / Move down alternative; track numbers change only after Save order. Each file keeps its status: Needs details and Processing block Review but do not prevent draft reordering.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "P7ucde",
      "x": 66000,
      "y": 12640,
      "name": "Product Note / Logic — lifecycle, archive and delete",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 160,
      "fill": "$color-background-tinted",
      "cornerRadius": 18,
      "stroke": "$color-border",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 10,
      "padding": [
        22,
        26
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "EPOGS",
          "name": "RU Note / Title",
          "fill": "$color-accent",
          "content": "Logic — lifecycle, archive and delete",
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "SWwGe",
          "name": "RU Note / Body",
          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1388,
          "content": "Status always includes its meaning and next step; color alone is insufficient. Archiving a published item removes it from the public catalog while preserving analytics, comments, history, and recovery. Permanent delete applies only to an eligible draft, names the exact object, and requires separate typed confirmation.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
