          "fill": "#C4B5FD",
          "content": "LOGIC · COMPLETED DASHBOARD SUMMARY",
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 1.4
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "jYxPm",
          "x": 24,
          "y": 52,
          "name": "Dashboard Note / Body",
          "fill": "#D1D5DB",
          "content": "Period, comparison, source, timezone, and freshness apply to every summary value. Metrics show Bitrate-owned data only; external destinations and revenue are not replaced with demo values. Current release remains the main work context, Needs attention contains immediate decisions, and lower cards provide catalog, dates, and activity without competing with the primary action. Mobile preserves the same decision order.",
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
